/-!
# Direct consumer of registered observer-submission authority

This certificate consumes the already proved arbitrary-universe exhaustion
law together with one non-vacuous M14 source installation.  The canonical
actual submission is read from the revised root's first event; its dependent
face shares the typed U8 new-only row, compiler successor and named runtime
core.  Presentation and rejected uses remain classified by the generic
compiler and do not acquire a second root occurrence.
-/

